      <description>Tata Sons Pvt. on Thursday decided to pursue a stock listing and extend its chairman’s term by five years despite strong — and public — opposition from the founding-family patriarch, setting up a showdown at one of India’s oldest conglomerates. Group stocks dropped Friday.</description>
